          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Dread Flickering"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, light)\n\n20 feet. A dread wisp, though naturally invisible, glows with a grayish illumination, casting dim light in the aura and making them visible. Living creatures that end their turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 25 Will saving throw or become frightened 1 (or frightened 2 on a critical failure)\n\nThose that critically succeed are temporarily immune for 10 minutes."
            },
